# Service-scoped instructions

When editing under `services/<name>/`, follow that service's nested `AGENTS.md`
and `.cursor/rules` for local engineering gates and safety.

Do **not** apply another service's detailed Scoring / HH browser / OSINT
evidence rules outside its own tree. Do not copy nested rule bodies into
workspace always-on context.
